# Terraform AWS IAM Standardized Naming & Governance

## Overview
This project implements standardized, lowercase, hyphenated naming conventions and automated governance tagging for AWS IAM resources using Terraform. Input parameters (`KKE_PROJECT`, `KKE_TEAM`, and `KKE_ENVIRONMENT`) are validated at runtime and sanitized inside a `locals` block before provisioning an IAM User and an EC2-assumable IAM Role.

